# Local Configuration

Copy to `.claude/config.local.md` and customize.
This file is gitignored - do not commit personal settings.

## ntfy Notifications

Get notified when long-running tasks complete:

```
NTFY_TOPIC=your-secret-topic
```

Install ntfy app and subscribe to your topic.
See: https://ntfy.sh

## Personal Storage Path

Override default path for `--private` tasks and personal knowledge:

```
personal_knowledge_path=~/.local/share/zappzarapp/
```

Default: `~/.local/share/zappzarapp/`
